        "head": [
          "\"\"\"Exclusive, attestable ownership of BAXY's loopback GUI listener.",
          "",
          "The lease binds and listens before expensive application construction.  The",
          "same socket is then handed to Uvicorn via ``Server.run(sockets=[...])`` so",
